    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6178" root="جله" body-key="j">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَلَهٌ</span></b> , (JK, S,) or ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَلْهَةٌ</span></b> , (K,) <i>Baldness in the
fore part of the head;</i> (S, K;) <i>which is the
beginning of</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَلَعٌ</span>; <i>like</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَلَحٌ</span>: (S:) or <i>baldness
of the greater part of the head;</i> (Msb;) <i>more
than</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَلَحٌ</span>, (JK,) <i>and more than</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَلَعٌ</span>, which is
more than <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَلَحٌ</span>. (Msb in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جلح</span>.)

